sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): n/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: N/a

    CSMS->>CS: GetBaseReportRequest
    CS-->>CSMS: GetBaseReportResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: NotifyReportRequest (requestId = <requestId>, reportData[0].component.name = SmartChargingCtrlr, reportData[0].variable.name = MaxExternalConstraintsId, reportData[0].variableAttribute.value = 2147400000)
    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyReportResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to send a TxDefaultProfile Charging Profile

    CSMS->>CS: SetChargingProfileRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: chargingProfile.id must be greater than 2147400000
    CS-->>CSMS: SetChargingProfileResponse (status = Accepted)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
